sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor You
    participant AG as ast-grep scan
    participant T as triage.sh
    participant C as classif
    participant M as Winnow 12B<br/>(Ollama, local)

    You->>AG: scan with the rules
    AG->>T: findings as JSON: the call, each rule's fix,<br/>its question, option and min_p
    T->>C: "What is this log line for?"<br/>options: debug, info
    C->>M: the line, answer with one token
    M-->>C: a score for each option
    C-->>T: debug 0.96
    T->>C: "Is the value a secret or personal data?"
    C-->>T: no
    alt sure enough and no veto
        T-->>You: the fix of the rule the answer picked, as a diff
    else below min_p, or the veto says yes
        T-->>You: left for a person
    end
